WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
A Lulav needs careful inspection for specific

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.040
defects.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.880
Review quality, not just ownership.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.060
Repeating a checklist helps notice mistakes that

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.700
automatic confidence can hide.
